{"id":"c112e121aec5c9ff","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-arithmetic.md","title":"Arithmetic","display":"df-arithmetic — Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-arithmetic","aliases":["58-df-arithmetic","Arithmetic"],"display":"df-arithmetic — Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[58-df-number-theory]]","[[58-df-integer]]","[[58-df-divisibility]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-arithmetic</span><span>Arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic — Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92b2961f9d6bbcaa\" href=\"?note=92b2961f9d6bbcaa\" title=\"58-df-number-theory\">58-df-number-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"244943f88396309f\" href=\"?note=244943f88396309f\" title=\"58-df-integer\">58-df-integer</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility\">58-df-divisibility</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb Z\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd,\\operatorname{lcm}:\\mathbb Z^2\\to\\omega\">\\(\\gcd,\\operatorname{lcm}:\\mathbb Z^2\\to\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the natural-number divisibility predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b932045a4446f26a\" href=\"?note=b932045a4446f26a\" title=\"58-df-divisibility\">58-df-divisibility</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\gcd(a,b)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;a=b=0,\\\\ \\max\\{d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\mid \\mathrm{Div}(d,|a|)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,|b|)\\},&amp;(a,b)\\neq(0,0),\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\gcd(a,b)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;a=b=0,\\\\ \\max\\{d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\mid \\mathrm{Div}(d,|a|)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,|b|)\\},&amp;(a,b)\\neq(0,0),\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;ab=0,\\\\ \\min\\{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\mid \\mathrm{Div}(|a|,m)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(|b|,m)\\},&amp;ab\\neq0.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;ab=0,\\\\ \\min\\{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\mid \\mathrm{Div}(|a|,m)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(|b|,m)\\},&amp;ab\\neq0.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bézout's identity is a theorem following from the gcd definition, not a defining clause.</li>\n<li>The familiar infix notation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\mid s\">\\(r\\mid s\\)</span> abbreviates the registered predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Div}(r,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Div}(r,s)\\)</span> on natural numbers; the defining clauses call that predicate directly.</li>\n<li>Arithmetic: operations and properties of integers</li>\n<li>Fundamental theorem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}\\)</span> is a unique factorization domain</li>\n<li>Diophantine equations: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ax + by = c\">\\(ax + by = c\\)</span> solvable iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gcd(a,b) \\mid c\">\\(\\gcd(a,b) \\mid c\\)</span></li>\n<li>Modular arithmetic: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a \\equiv b \\pmod{n} \\Leftrightarrow n \\mid (a-b)\">\\(a \\equiv b \\pmod{n} \\Leftrightarrow n \\mid (a-b)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hardy and Wright, Introduction to the Theory of Numbers</li>\n<li>Niven, Zuckerman, Montgomery, An Introduction to the Theory of Numbers</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-number-theory","status":"resolved","id":"92b2961f9d6bbcaa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-number-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integer","status":"resolved","id":"244943f88396309f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integer]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-divisibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-divisibility","status":"resolved","id":"b932045a4446f26a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the natural-number divisibility predicate (see [[58-df-divisibility]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\gcd,\\operatorname{lcm}:\\mathbb Z^2\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Div}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\gcd(a,b)=\\begin{cases}0,&a=b=0,\\\\ \\max\\{d\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\mid \\mathrm{Div}(d,|a|)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(d,|b|)\\},&(a,b)\\neq(0,0),\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash \\operatorname{lcm}(a,b)=\\begin{cases}0,&ab=0,\\\\ \\min\\{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\mid \\mathrm{Div}(|a|,m)\\land\\mathrm{Div}(|b|,m)\\},&ab\\neq0.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"r\\mid s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Div}(r,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{Z}","display":false},{"tex":"ax + by = c","display":false},{"tex":"\\gcd(a,b) \\mid c","display":false},{"tex":"a \\equiv b \\pmod{n} \\Leftrightarrow n \\mid (a-b)","display":false}],"bytes":1574,"backlinks":[{"id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9fa1a80aa97659ab","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-arithmetic.md|58-df-arithmetic]]（batch19）"},{"id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["92b2961f9d6bbcaa","244943f88396309f","b932045a4446f26a"]}